# Tauri / Rust
# =========================
desktop/src-tauri/target/
target/
# PyInstaller onedir payload is generated by build-windows-runtime.ps1 and is
# fingerprinted into the release manifest. Never commit the bundled Python
# runtime or its transient customer runtime seed.
desktop/src-tauri/runtime/seroguld-runtime/

